        "Level\nIntervention/Prevention"
      ],
      "heading_level": 1,
      "caption": null,
      "context_before": null,
      "footnote_candidates": [
        "A systematic review by Kelly et al112 explored the readiness\nfor clinical adoption of 15 formalized prognostic clinical pre\ndiction rules for early identification of the patient at risk of\ntransitioning to chronic neck pain. Of those, 11 remained in\nthe derivation stage, lacking external validation. Four had\nundergone some degree of external validation, but none were\nat the stage of readiness to be endorsed for widespread clini\ncal adoption.112,171"
      ],
